  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Inscr.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> Inscr.</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="Hl Inscr." corresp="#wit-h">þis syndon þa domas ðe Hloþhære ⁊ Eadric, Cantwara cyningas, asetton.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">þis syndon þa domas ðe Hloþhære ⁊ Eadric Cantwara cyningas asetton.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">These are the decrees which Hloþhere and Eadric, kings of the Kentish people, set.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">These are the decrees which Hlothhere and Eadric, Kings of Kent, established.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-h">These are the decrees which Hlothhere and Eadric, kings of the people of Kent, established.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Dies sind die Gesetze, welche Hlothaere und Eadric, Könige der Kenter, festsetzten.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">These are the laws which Hlothhere and Eadric, kings of the Kentish people, established.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
